MOLite Core includes software derived from MOMO Core.
Public source: https://github.com/ppisky/MOMO-core
Verified public revision: ef8425d3ef872cc9ed4491fc1e923e5a4ba40b8b
License: Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE).

src/vendor/moc.rs and tests/vendor/moc.rs originate from momo-moc.
src/vendor/crypto.rs and tests/vendor/crypto.rs originate from momo-crypto.
Only test module paths were changed on import. Further changes are recorded in Git.
MOLite's DMW-only runtime and provider adapter follow the MOMO design, with no
Space ownership, NSG engine, vector storage or external character card support.
